  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758555,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007: Quantum of Solace - Nintendo DS Synopsis\n\nStep into the world of espionage with 007: Quantum of Solace on the Nintendo DS, a thrilling third-person shooter experience based on the James Bond films *Casino Royale* and *Quantum of Solace*. Assume the role of the iconic 007 as he unravels a conspiracy involving the shadowy organization Quantum, beginning with the kidnapping of Mr. White.\n\nThe DS version delivers a unique gameplay experience, blending stealth, action, and gadgetry. Utilize Bond’s signature tools and skills to infiltrate enemy bases, engage in intense firefights, and uncover the truth behind Quantum’s sinister plans. The storyline weaves together events from both films, though players should be aware that the narrative jumps between timelines, requiring familiarity with the source material to fully grasp the plot.\n\nExperience familiar faces like Judi Dench as M and relive key moments from *Casino Royale* alongside new adventures in Bolivia. With a focus on tactical combat and a distinctive third-person perspective, 007: Quantum of Solace on DS offers a portable dose of Bond action and intrigue."
    },
